    cat <<EOF
MyVPS v${MYVPS_VERSION} - VPS Management Tool

Usage: myvps [module] [action] [args...]

Modules:
  domain      Domain management (add, list, delete, suspend)
  db          Database management (create, delete, import, export)
  php         PHP management (version, config)
  nginx       Nginx management (config, restart)
  ssl         SSL certificate management
  ssh         SSH/SFTP management
  firewall    Firewall/port management
  cache       Cache management (Redis, Memcached, OPcache)
  swap        Swap management
  backup      Backup & restore
  wp          WordPress management
  laravel     Laravel management
  monitor     System monitoring
  log         Log management
  port        Port management
  fail2ban    Fail2Ban management
  admin       Admin panel management
  cron        Crontab management
  util        Utility tools
  info        VPS information
  update      Update MyVPS
  status      System status

Options:
  --json      Output in JSON format (for Web UI)
  -h, --help  Show this help
  -v          Show version

Examples:
  myvps                       # Interactive menu
  myvps domain add            # Add new domain
  myvps domain list           # List all domains
